# Only what the image builds need: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE, src/ and
# the Robot resources and library adapter for the orchestrator, and the client and server
# scripts for the iperf2 workload image.
*
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!robot/resources
!robot/libraries
!images/iperf2/dokimi-iperf2-client.sh
!images/iperf2/dokimi-iperf2-server.sh
src/**/__pycache__
robot/**/__pycache__
